stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> IntentCreated
  IntentCreated --> LockPosted: authority + accounting allow
  IntentCreated --> Denied: invalid/legal/risk/capability failure
  LockPosted --> Authorized: signed authorization valid
  LockPosted --> Expired: expiry/revocation
  Authorized --> BroadcastRequested: environment attestation valid
  BroadcastRequested --> BroadcastEvidenced: evidence observed
  BroadcastRequested --> BroadcastAmbiguous: timeout/unknown delivery
  BroadcastRequested --> BroadcastRejected: evidence of rejection
  BroadcastEvidenced --> Confirmed: chain/venue finality evidence
  BroadcastEvidenced --> Reorged: reorg/conflict evidence
  BroadcastAmbiguous --> ReconciliationRequired
  BroadcastRejected --> ReconciliationRequired
  Reorged --> ReconciliationRequired
  ReconciliationRequired --> CorrectionProposed: separate authority flow
  CorrectionProposed --> [*]
  Confirmed --> [*]
  Denied --> [*]
  Expired --> [*]
  note right of BroadcastAmbiguous
    Prohibit automatic retry and
    a second economic mutation.
  end note
